deploy-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#startup-opt-in","content":"Startup opt-in","locale":"zh-TW"},"242":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-8","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#與-searchparameter-derived-index-的關係","content":"與 SearchParameter derived index 的關係","locale":"zh-TW"},"243":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-9","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#使用-nodejs","content":"您會看到 console 打印以下訊息：","locale":"zh-TW"},"244":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-10","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#使用-docker-compose","content":"以下是來自根目錄 `docker-compose.yaml` 的範例","locale":"zh-TW"},"245":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-11","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#mongodb-schema-與-index-provisioning","content":"Burni 預設將 Mongoose `autoCreate` 與 `autoIndex` 設為 `false`。Model registration 只代表 application process 內已註冊 model，**不保證** MongoDB collection 或 index 已存在。正式部署應在 application 啟動前執行 provisioning，或明確啟用 startup opt-in。","locale":"zh-TW"},"246":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-12","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#mongodb-schema-與-index-provisioning","content":"期望的 collection 與 index manifest 會在執行時依已註冊 model、model catalog、approved built-in temporal 定義，以及通過 policy 的非 temporal SearchParameter derived index 以 deterministic 方式產生。Manifest 會保存 `artifactIdentity`（compiled SearchParameter artifact）與 `derivedIndexPolicy.searchParameterPolicyVersion`（non-temporal index policy）。Provisioning 會依該 manifest 與 MongoDB 實際狀態 reconcile，並將結果寫入 `MongoProvisioningState`；多 instance 執行時由 `MongoProvisioningLock` 以 database-scoped lease 互斥。需要 JSON 副本時可用 `writeDesiredManifestArtifact()` 寫出（預設路徑 `models/mongodb/provisioning/artifacts/desired-index-manifest.json`）。","locale":"zh-TW"},"247":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-13","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#部署前-provisioning建議","content":"設定與 application 相同的 MongoDB 連線環境變數（`MONGODB_CONNECTION_URL`，或 `MONGODB_HOSTS` / `MONGODB_PORTS` / `MONGODB_NAME`），然後執行：","locale":"zh-TW"},"248":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-14","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#部署前-provisioning建議","content":"此 command 依序完成 control-plane 初始化、取得 lock、建立 collections、建立 baseline indexes、建立 approved built-in derived indexes（temporal 與非 temporal SearchParameter）、執行 verify，並保存 manifest checksum 與 drift 摘要。成功時 exit code 為 `0`；任一 phase 失敗時回傳非零狀態。","locale":"zh-TW"},"249":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-15","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#部署前-provisioning建議","content":"**部分完成與重試**：Provisioning 採 additive-only policy，不 rollback 已建立的 collection 或 index。若 run 在中途失敗，已完成的 DDL 會保留；再次執行 `mongodb:provision` 會從 desired/actual diff 繼續補齊缺少項目。Lock lease 到期後可由其他 process 回收 expired lock 並重試。","locale":"zh-TW"},"250":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-16","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#只讀-verify","content":"`mongodb:verify` **不執行任何 DDL**，也不修改資料。它只讀取 actual collections 與 indexes，回報：","locale":"zh-TW"},"251":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-17","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#只讀-verify","content":"**missing**：期望存在但資料庫缺少的 index","locale":"zh-TW"},"252":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-18","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#只讀-verify","content":"**extra**：資料庫存在但 manifest 未宣告的 index（只報告，不刪除）","locale":"zh-TW"},"253":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-19","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#只讀-verify","content":"**mismatch**：key 或 options 與期望不一致的 index","locale":"zh-TW"},"254":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-20","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#只讀-verify","content":"**manifest identity drift**：目前 desired manifest 的 checksum 或 version 與 `MongoProvisioningState` 中最近一次成功 run 保存的值不一致","locale":"zh-TW"},"255":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-21","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#只讀-verify","content":"verify 失敗時 exit code 為 `2`。","locale":"zh-TW"},"256":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-22","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#id-duplicate-audit只讀","content":"掃描 resource 與 history collections 中的 duplicate `id`，供未來 unique migration 前的 clean-audit gate 使用。**不修改任何資料**。一般 provisioning **不會**自動將既有 `id` index 改為 unique。","locale":"zh-TW"},"257":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-23","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#startup-opt-in","content":"預設 `node server.js` **不會**執行 provisioning；application readiness（`mongodb.ready`）與 provisioning readiness 是分開的狀態。缺少 performance index（包含 non-temporal derived index）不會阻止 HTTP listen，但可能導致 COLLSCAN；`mongodb:verify` diagnostics 會標示 missing performance index。","locale":"zh-TW"},"258":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-24","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#startup-opt-in","content":"若要在 application ready 前等待完整 provisioning run，設定：","locale":"zh-TW"},"259":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-25","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#startup-opt-in","content":"或 `MONGODB_PROVISION_ON_STARTUP=1`。啟用後，server bootstrap 會在 listen 前執行與 `mongodb:provision` 相同的 locked run；失敗時不宣告 ready、不 listen，並以非零狀態結束 process。正式環境仍建議使用獨立 deployment command，而非 startup opt-in。","locale":"zh-TW"},"260":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy-26","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/deploy#與-searchparameter-derived-index-的關係","content":"Derived index manifest 合併 temporal 與通過 policy 的非 temporal（token、reference、string、number、quantity、uri）built-in lookup。Database 自訂 SearchParameter 仍可執行查詢，但預設不建立 derived index。Derived index reconcile 為 additive-only：missing 可由 `provision` 建立，extra 或 mismatch 只由 `verify` 報告，不自動刪除；query runtime 不使用 `$hint`。Rollback 時可停止新 policy 或回復 manifest 版本，已建立的 index 不會被自動刪除。詳見 搜尋參數概觀 與 ADR 0010。","locale":"zh-TW"},"261":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","type":"page","content":"安裝","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v2 (LTS)","讓我們開始吧！"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","locale":"zh-TW"},"262":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation#installation","content":"Installation","locale":"zh-TW"},"263":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation#使用-git","content":"使用 git","locale":"zh-TW"},"264":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation-2","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation#installation","content":"請確認您的環境有以下內容：","locale":"zh-TW"},"265":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation-3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation#installation","content":"git","locale":"zh-TW"},"266":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation-4","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation#installation","content":"Node.JS >= 22","locale":"zh-TW"},"267":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation-5","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation#installation","content":"MongoDB > 4.2","locale":"zh-TW"},"268":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation-6","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation#使用-git","content":"從 git 複製專案","locale":"zh-TW"},"269":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation#使用-git","content":"安裝套件","locale":"zh-TW"},"270":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation-8","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/getting-started/installation#使用-git","content":"安裝完畢後，下一步進行設定","locale":"zh-TW"},"271":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","type":"page","content":"自行新增搜尋參數","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v2 (LTS)","搜尋參數"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","locale":"zh-TW"},"272":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#範例bundlecomposition-與-bundlemessage","content":"範例：Bundle.composition 與 Bundle.message","locale":"zh-TW"},"273":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#直接-identity-搜尋","content":"直接 identity 搜尋","locale":"zh-TW"},"274":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-2","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#chained-search","content":"Chained search","locale":"zh-TW"},"275":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-TW"},"276":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-4","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","content":"與搜尋參數相關的程式碼位於`models\\FHIR\\queryBuild.js` 以及 `models\\FHIR\\searchParameterQueryHandler.js` 檔案。","locale":"zh-TW"},"277":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-5","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","content":"`queryBuild.js`: 根據不同的 Data Type 組成單個MongoDB 查詢語法。","locale":"zh-TW"},"278":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-6","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","content":"`searchParameterQueryHandler.js`: 根據 HTTP 網址中的查詢條件使用 `queryBuild.js` 取得完整的 MongoDB 查詢語法。","locale":"zh-TW"},"279":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","content":"由產生器產生之部分搜尋參數可能是錯誤的或遺失。您可以使用 `models\\FHIR\\searchParameterQueryHandler.js` 內的方法修正。","locale":"zh-TW"},"280":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-8","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#範例bundlecomposition-與-bundlemessage","content":"FHIR R4 將 `Bundle.composition` 與 `Bundle.message` 定義為 reference 搜尋參數。Burni 透過 SearchParameter Registry 解析這兩個參數，且只評估 `entry[0].resource`：","locale":"zh-TW"},"281":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-9","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#範例bundlecomposition-與-bundlemessage","content":"`composition` — `type` 為 `document`、第一個 entry 為 `Composition` 的 Bundle","locale":"zh-TW"},"282":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-10","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#範例bundlecomposition-與-bundlemessage","content":"`message` — `type` 為 `message`、第一個 entry 為 `MessageHeader` 的 Bundle","locale":"zh-TW"},"283":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-11","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#範例bundlecomposition-與-bundlemessage","content":"Burni 不會對整個 `entry` 陣列做 fan-out，只有第一個 embedded resource 會參與這類特殊搜尋。","locale":"zh-TW"},"284":{"id":"/zh