ry[0].resource`；即使後續 entry 含有符合條件的 Composition 或 MessageHeader，也不會影響結果。","locale":"zh-TW"},"290":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter-18","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/add-search-parameter#限制","content":"Bundle type 與第一個 entry 的 resource type 必須相符；不符合 FHIR 約束的 stored Bundle 只是不命中，不會回傳參數錯誤。","locale":"zh-TW"},"291":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","type":"page","content":"概觀","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v2 (LTS)","搜尋參數"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","locale":"zh-TW"},"292":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#搜尋參數概觀","content":"搜尋參數概觀","locale":"zh-TW"},"293":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#search-parameter-types","content":"Search Parameter Types","locale":"zh-TW"},"294":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-2","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#parameters-for-all-resources","content":"Parameters for all resources","locale":"zh-TW"},"295":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#search-result-parameters","content":"Search result parameters","locale":"zh-TW"},"296":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-4","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#derived-index-與自訂-searchparameter","content":"Derived index 與自訂 SearchParameter","locale":"zh-TW"